 "remarks": "AVAIL NOV 2, 2026 through JUNE 11, 2027 for $18,950/mo. (3-month minimum). ALSO AVAIL SUMMER 2027 for $49,950/mo. or ANNUAL for $23,950. Like-new, tastefully furnished Compo Beach gem with private seasonal pool and unobstructed water/park views. Steps to sand/water, ample parking, glass roof deck, 9' ceilings. In the center of it all yet private due to its unique configuration & UV floor-to-ceiling windows. Enjoy panoramic 180-degree views of LI Sound from the 722 SF glass deck as you lounge. Stroll to Compo Beach & its many amenities. Sunlit views from the top-level great room with dining and chef's kitchen & spacious primary suite (comb. twins), which are all steps from the deck. Main level has 3 more ensuite BRS (King as 2nd primary option, Queen & Twin), laundry room & office/bedroom with kitchenette & stairs to pool. Large Subzero fridge plus fridge drawers, dual-fuel Wolf range, Miele dishwasher, 2nd dishwasher, Legacy solid painted maple Shaker cabinets & quartz counters. All-Clad & Le Creuset etc. cookware. FEMA compliant home has 2 garages, 5 guest parking places, great REC/cabana area (596SF) w/fully retractable glass-paneled door to pool & fenced backyard. Spectacular, pristine home has a versatile floor plan: energy-efficient and low maintenance for carefree seaside living. IMPORTANT. *Leases under 90 days incur 15% CT tax on the first 30 days.",
